   bal_ftz:
     0: NO ftz in payment_balance or end_term (pure x87_mul / x87_add / x87_div -> st64!)
     1: ftz on end_term ONLY, NO ftz in payment_balance
     2: origin/master (ftz on end_term AND present_comp, payment_comp, sum)
     3: ftz on sum of payment_balance ONLY
